      "judgment": "The full two-file patch guards exit when the panel view is unavailable immediately after open. The current owned exit method tests !animationsEnabled || !this.panel before accessing nativeElement, cancels prior exit resources and completes the matching owned sequence. Completion clears _overlayAttached, emits one void state and the unchanged public CdkConnectedOverlay template binding applies detachment; it does not import the modern private detach method. The real native test recreates the owned enabled-motion configuration and calls public open/close before a panel view resolves, then checks closed/unattached state and absence of a panel after flushing. Source/protocol diagnostics cannot substitute for that Angular artifact test. No product or consumer structure/style/API edit is required."
    }
